This started out as "get the boring old Caveman out of the way" in my
gradual working through of the classes on NAO, but after #rub on a
blessed magic lamp gave me the unfortunate 20% result, and especially
once I found myself with about -15 AC and way over 100 HP before even
reaching the Quest portal level, I decided I'd try doing it wishless.
I very nearly went for genoless as well, certainly it was a long way
into Gehennom before I thought I'd play it safe and get rid of the
usual suspects - given that I'd done genoless before but not wishless,
it just seemed the sensible thing to do.

After (eventually) clearing out an early potion shop and doing some
alchemy I ended up with quite a few potions of gain level, which I
kept in my bag (hoping to keep generated monsters a bit less nasty)
right until the Sanctum. That got me to level 29, and after randomly
finding another !oGL I think this was actually the first time I've
ever reached XL 30.

Astral was a bit tricky because I'd run down my wands of death almost
completely (through being excessively wary of mind flayers when they
were still around), I think I only had one shot left which I used on
Famine. But for once I made good use of my teleport wands, and bearing
in mind my slightly iffy AC I didn't really have too much trouble.


